1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,320
 I felt relieved in that moment, but also humbled.

2
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:13,000
 I recognized the quiet rebuke of misplaced buttons and tiny fingers, reminding me that

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,420
 I should be trying to be more like Jesus.

4
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:23,800
 That small but majestic moment helped me embrace what Elder Patrick Kieran has described as

5
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:28,560
 a radical reorientation of my soul.

6
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:32,680
 I don't recall the topic of the primary program that day,

7
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:35,560
 but the message I received through the Holy Ghost

8
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:38,000
 prompted a spiritual realignment.

9
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:43,160
 A little child led me to learn this.

10
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:46,560
 That a true disciple of Jesus Christ

11
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:50,200
 is quick to help and slow to judge.

12
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:54,840
 The Savior taught this loving principle of disciples,

